  "contentHtml": "<p>학기초 평가계획 관련 교과협의록 예시</p><p>1학년 자유학기제 평가계획 예시</p><p>2,3학년 평가계획 예시</p><p>지필고사 원안지(시험지 양식)</p><p>문항정보표</p><p>교과진도운영계획</p><p>평가 출제 관련 교과협의록</p><p>서술형평가 문제지 예시</p><p>서술형평가 채점 기준표</p><p>수행평가 반영비율</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/35182320181b958085493529d413d84ec7718cd5?download\" data-file-name=\"평가계획 양식 모음.zip\" data-file-size=\"720555\" data-mimetype=\"application/x-zip-compressed\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DI6d%26dataid%3D162%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20210603104029&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F35182320181b958085493529d413d84ec7718cd5')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">평가계획 양식 모음</span><span class=\"type\">.zip</span></div><div class=\"size\">703.67KB</div></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>출처&#160;<a href=\"http://cafe.naver.com/lessonlab\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">http://cafe.naver.com/lessonlab</a>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"수업연구소 : 네이버 카페\" data-og-description=\"수업연구소, 교과수업, 학급경영자료, 자유학기제, 동아리활동, 평가 등 선생님의 수업과 업무 지원 카페\" data-og-host=\"cafe.naver.com\" data-og-source-url=\"http://cafe.naver.com/lessonlab\" data-og-url=\"https://cafe.naver.com/lessonlab\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/28i8J/hyKqJfsuG1/Hjygwr693OeLaOqh4sGJ80/img.jpg?width=150&amp;height=150&amp;face=0_0_150_150\"><a href=\"http://cafe.naver.com/lessonlab\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"http://cafe.naver.com/lessonlab\"><div class=\"og-image\" style=\"background-image:url(https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/28i8J/hyKqJfsuG1/Hjygwr693OeLaOqh4sGJ80/img.jpg?width=150&amp;height=150&amp;face=0_0_150_150)\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">수업연구소 : 네이버 카페</p><p class=\"og-desc\">수업연구소, 교과수